^{:go/end 69} (go/func computeCallSiteTable "computeCallSiteTable builds and returns a table of call sites for\nthe specified region in function fn. A region here corresponds to a\nspecific subtree within the AST for a function. The main intended\nuse cases are for 'region' to be either A) an entire function body,\nor B) an inlined call expression.\n" ^CallSiteTab [^{:tag (* ir/Func)} fn ^ir/Nodes region ^CallSiteTab cstab ^{:tag (map ir/Node pstate)} ptab ^int loopNestingLevel ^{:tag (* nameFinder)} nf]
