    nil))








^{:go/end 413} (go/func UpdateCallsiteTable "UpdateCallsiteTable handles updating of callerfn's call site table\nafter an inlined has been carried out, e.g. the call at 'n' as been\nturned into the inlined call expression 'ic' within function\ncallerfn. The chief thing of interest here is to make sure that any\ncall nodes within 'ic' are added to the call site table for\n'callerfn' and scored appropriately.\n" [^{:tag (* ir/Func)} callerfn ^{:tag (* ir/CallExpr)} n ^{:tag (* ir/InlinedCallExpr)} ic]
